        <span class="eyebrow">Hi, I'm Julie</span>
        <h2>Creative Entrepreneur,<br>Maker & Brand Builder</h2>
        <div class="divider divider--left"></div>

        <p class="lead">I've spent years turning ideas into brands — and I love every minute of it. In Good Company is where my passions for design, making, and helping businesses thrive all come together.</p>

        <p style="color:var(--clr-brown-light);">Whether I'm designing a website, mapping out a social media strategy, laser engraving a personalized gift, or building an entirely new brand from scratch — I bring the same energy to everything: creativity, intentionality, and a genuine love for the work.</p>

        <p style="color:var(--clr-brown-light);">I started In Good Company because I believe every small business deserves beautiful branding, every person deserves a thoughtful gift, and every maker deserves a community to grow in. This is that place.</p>

        <p style="color:var(--clr-brown-light);">When I'm not at my desk or in my studio, you'll find me hunting for vintage finds, planning my next travel adventure with Flights Alright, or probably making something I didn't need to make but absolutely had to.</p>

        <div class="about__signature">— Julie</div>

        <div class="about__values">
          <div class="about__value">Made with intention</div>
          <div class="about__value">Built for real people</div>
          <div class="about__value">Creative to the core</div>
          <div class="about__value">Community over competition</div>
          <div class="about__value">Always learning</div>
          <div class="about__value">Details matter</div>
        </div>
